{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>今日（3日）上午8時許，警方接報北角春秧街93-113號仁德大廈一個單位內，有一塊約1米乘1.5米的石屎，突然從天花板跌下，擊中年約90歲老婦。救援人員到場，老婦頭部受傷流血，隨後由救護車送往東區醫院治理，警方正在現場調查。</p><figure><img alt=\"單位內一名老婦遭天花跌下的石屎擊中頭部受傷。（翁鈺輝攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260903/1172123151791034368086731.jpeg/-VVy2IhFH-Hd3ziF6QgF5Wv3ERfz_1QuumvJy59rycs\"/><figcaption>單位內一名老婦遭天花跌下的石屎擊中頭部受傷。（翁鈺輝攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"現場是仁德大廈。（翁鈺輝攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260903/1172123148976525312054392.jpeg/mrKf0TnXAWfAFXiV-cSxycvuwDI1vPW5Y0gpT0ZIKU8\"/><figcaption>現場是仁德大廈。（翁鈺輝攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"現場是仁德大廈。（翁鈺輝攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260903/1172123146174599168837190.jpeg/llfrna4TAPGICmyRprwxhP68T80ayiiITt5EWWveRFk\"/><figcaption>現場是仁德大廈。（翁鈺輝攝）</figcaption></figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260903/1172123758299713536061758.jpeg/j7xNJqIfe8_wF1x6hhPNQKvkFp0Ulkrb6I-yLuiPsi4\"/><figure><img alt=\"老婦頭部受傷送院。\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260903/1172123760812232704183569.jpeg/w6ANSHai8xa67aiWjt5IshWuHtTAkYCMoJMX-aCTF_k\"/><figcaption>老婦頭部受傷送院。</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-03T02:23:55.987564+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":181,"images":5,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none"}}